# Code owners for the files that define this repository's rules (ADR-0009).
#
# Everything else has no owner, so ordinary changes need no extra review. Once the repository
# moves to an organization with a second maintainer, replace @Khoiiminh with the core team
# (for example @codeatlas/core) and turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in both rulesets.
# Until then GitHub only requests a review; nothing is blocked.

# CI, branch policy and this file
